          "explanation": "Doctor assigns concrete tasks: one person to confirm symptoms and records, one to organize medications, and one to contact the transplant team.",
          "quote": "把出院前的交接责任问清楚，把用药原则守住，把后续跟进路径定下来"
        },
        {
          "event_id": "lite_evt_00197",
          "explanation": "Doctor specifies timing and fallback paths for result review and emergency escalation.",
          "quote": "24-48小时内尿培养结果由谁负责查看？（建议明确是肾内科或移植门诊）"
        }
      ],
      "explanation": "RC6 is met by a concrete plan with tasks, timing, and destination.",
      "issue_kind": "none",
      "rc_id": "RC6",
      "status": "met"
    },
    {
      "citations": [
        {
          "event_id": "lite_evt_00151",
          "explanation": "Doctor asks the caregiver to confirm the plan in their own words.",
          "quote": "您已经把所有关键点都抓得很准了"
        },
        {
          "event_id": "lite_evt_00167",
          "explanation": "Family demonstrates receipt by summarizing the plan.",
          "quote": "抗排异药也是只按医院交接单吃，把药盒放我这边看着"
