          "event_id": "lite_evt_00082",
          "explanation": "Doctor uses conditional language and avoids declaring hematuria or rejection without evidence.",
          "quote": "这些情况提示可能存在药物相关肾损伤、急性肾损伤或排斥反应早期"
        },
        {
          "event_id": "lite_evt_00106",
          "explanation": "Doctor keeps immunosuppressant changes under offline clinician supervision.",
          "quote": "医生会根据尿液颜色、肾功能和用药情况综合判断是否需要紧急处理"
        }
      ],
      "explanation": "RC8 is met by avoiding unsupported diagnosis and keeping medication changes under professional supervision.",
      "issue_kind": "none",
      "rc_id": "RC8",
      "status": "met"
    }
  ]
